<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/48/msa@/~cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "12" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/48/msa@> .
